<title>
Cowl Side Outer Member Removal and Installation
</title>
<attention3>
<ptxt>
The figure below shows condition where the following parts are removed.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Front fender: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENKSB0A9A06005"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Front fender bracket, front fender upper front bracket, front fender lower bracket and front fender lower bracket extension: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENKSB0A9B06002"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</attention3>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IGSB0A9B0041.jpg" width = "183.000mm" height = "90.159mm" ver = "01" gw = "335" gh = "239"/>
</figure>
<servinfosub id = "AENKSB0A9B06003001">
<title>
General Notes
</title>
<ptxt>
Welding method and number of welding points are the same on both sides. This repair instruction shows procedure for left side.
</ptxt>
</servinfosub>
<servinfosub id = "AENKSB0A9B06003002">
<title>
Removal
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Unscrew 3 bolts.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Drill out welding spots and remove cowl side outer member.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IHSB0A9B0005.jpg" width = "183.000mm" height = "118.776mm" ver = "01" gw = "402" gh = "320"/>
