<servinfosub id = "AENKSB0A9B06003003">
<title>
Installation
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install cowl side outer member, tighten 3 bolts temporarily and adjust position relative to adjoining parts.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Conduct resistance spot weld or plug weld.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Tighten 3 bolts to specified torque.
</ptxt>
